    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8641" root="حقل" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْقَلةٌ</span></b>  sing. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَاقِلُ</span>, (TK,) which signifies
<i>Places of seed-produce;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَزَارِعُ</span>. (K: but
in some copies, in the place of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَحَاقِلُ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَزَارِعُ</span>, we find <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُحَاقِلُ</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُزَارِعُ</span>.) [See an
ex. voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْقَنَةٌ</span>.]

